        "action": "Review penalties for disruptive and dangerous parking",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "We want the Government to conduct a review of existing powers to issue fines where cars are blocking emergency gates or parked in an anti-social way, for example leading to others having to reverse dangerously on main roads when cars are blocking turn around areas.",
